"title":"Masala Dosa",
    "image":"breakfast_items/masala_dosa/breakfast_items/masala_dosa.jpg",
    "HowToPrepare":"Ingredients:\n
    1 cup dosa rice\n
    1/2 cup urad dal\n
    1 teaspoon methi\n
    1 table spoon chana dal\n
    For Masala:\n
    potato\n
    coriander leaves\n
    green chilli\n
    onion\n
    salt\n
    How to prepare:
    First soak rice, urad dal, methi and chana dal for 6 hours and grind it into smooth paste and ferment this 
    for overnight. for masala: in a pan add some oil and add 1 teaspoon urad dal, 
    mustard seeds, hing, curry leaves, dried red chilli and splutter and add onion and fry 
    for 2 minutes, after that add green chilli, mashed potatotes salt to taste and add 1 teaspoon sugar add some water and adjust the consistency keep the masala little bit thick.
    now in a dosa pan make dosa and apply red chilli paste and prepared masala and 
    serve dosa in hot.  
    "
